===Etymology===
From {{Ger.|ang}} ''*ders-'', from {{IE.|ang}} ''*dhers-''.  Cognate with Old Frisian ''dūra'' (Frisian [[doare]]), Old High German [[giturran]], Old Saxon [[gidurran]]; and with Greek [[θαρσειν]] ‘be bold’.

